Sender: linux-kernel-owner@vger.kernel.org
To: linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org, stable@vger.kernel.org
Cc: Mans Rullgard <mans@mansr.com>, Tony Lindgren <tony@atomide.com>, Sasha Levin <sashal@kernel.org>, linux-omap@vger.kernel.org, devicetree@vger.kernel.org
